If a previous upload was successful (setting `previewUrl`), and a subsequent upload fails or is malformed, the stale preview image will still be displayed alongside the error message. Consider clearing `previewUrl` when an error occurs to ensure the UI state remains consistent.

```
if (!base64) {
				error = 'Image could not be read. Please try again.';
				previewUrl = '';
				return;
			}
```
